@format 1
@id media-preview.in-convert
@title In Convert
@section Media preview
@area In Convert
@entry convert-path-change
@summary Show only the Convert-specific step that bridges shared Files selection into shared viewer preview loading.
@related media-loading.common.files-intake, media-selection.common.files-selection, media-preview.common.viewer-gate
@tag media
@tag preview
@tag convert

@alias convert = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainArea.PConvertTab

[convert-path-change] Convert Files current-path event <input>
~ This starts when the selected file changes in the Convert tab.
[Technical explanation]
= Shared Files logic published the current path through PListPathChange.
> convert-path-result

[convert-path-result] Convert selected-path adapter <decision>
~ The Convert tab decides what to do with the newly selected media path.
[Technical explanation]
- Ignore a blank path; otherwise request it from the Convert viewer @ convert.PConvertPathShow(...)
? "Nonblank current path" > map:media-preview.common.viewer-gate
? "Blank current path" > convert-no-request

[convert-no-request] Convert viewer request omitted <output>
~ This path ends with convert viewer request omitted.
[Technical explanation]
= Convert does not call the shared viewer-preview pipeline.
